            <img src="img/case-studies/cft/cftBanner.jpg" alt="Banner that hangs behind the band for gigs.">
            <figcaption>Banner that hangs behind the band for gigs &#40;4&#8242; &#215; 6&#8242;&#41;</figcaption>
        </figure>
